Install Cubic
1. sudo apt-add-repository ppa:cubic-wizard/release
2. sudo apt update
3. sudo apt install cubic

Shared Folder
1. Shutdown VM Linux
2. Settings → Shared Folders → Klik Add New
3. Devices → Insert Guest Additions CD Image
4. sudo mkdir -p /media/cdrom
5. sudo mount /dev/cdrom /media/cdrom
6. sudo /media/cdrom/VBoxLinuxAdditions.run
7. sudo usermod -aG vboxsf $USER
8. reboot

Membuat Folder
1. Masuk file manager → Documents → New Folder

Atur Project Cubic
1. Masukkan file iso ubuntu (Filename Original Disk) Pilih di mana file disimpan
2. Ubah nama (Filename Custom Disk) menjadi worklyn-office-os-1.0-desktop-amd64.iso
3. ubah version menjadi 1.0
4. Ubah nama Ubuntu 20.04 (Volume ID) menjadi Worklyn OS 1.0 LTS amd64
5. Ubah release menjadi Office Projected Release, Lalu klik next di atas
6. Terakhir akan terbuka terminal cubic (root@cubic:~#)

Install Aplikasi
1. apt update
2. Instal Libreoffice → apt install libreoffice -y
3. Install Okular → apt install -y okular
4. Install Thunderbird Email Client → apt install thunderbird -y
5. Install Firefox → apt install firefox -y
5. Calculator & ekstrak zip/rar. → apt install gnome-calculator file-roller -y
6. Printer & Scanner → apt install system-config-printer simple-scan -y
7. Font kompatibel MS Office → apt install fonts-crosextra-carlito fonts-crosextra-caladea -y

Hapus Aplikasi Tidak Perlu
1. hapus game → apt purge -y pidgin gnome-mahjongg gnome-mines gnome-sudoku
2. hapus multimedia → apt purge -y rhythmbox totem parole
3. bersihkan sisa → apt autoremove -y
                    apt clean

Perapian menu
1. sembunyikan game → mkdir -p /etc/xdg/menus/applications-merged
                      nano /etc/xdg/menus/applications-merged/no-games.menu
<!DOCTYPE Menu PUBLIC "-//freedesktop//DTD Menu 1.0//EN"
